{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YbG93FJNId1793614992.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產康怡逸樺園分行高級資深分區營業經理張略欣表示，分行促成北角港濤軒租賃成交，單位為低層C室，實用面積1,003平方呎，採4房1套間隔，向北，享園景及部分海景，最新以6萬元租出，折合實用呎租59.8元。</p><p> </p><p>張略欣表示，新租客為內地專才，心儀上址位處北角核心地段，周邊生活及交通配套完善，遂決定承租。據了解，業主於2012年以1,400萬元購入單位，持貨14年，是次出租可享約5.1厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:16.350363+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:18:12.673740+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:21.726555+00:00","content_hash":"50b5df004b74c9e9ff701dd43d17ab3f9e6de0b151de0d4e4562faaf79b98beb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:16.350363+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}